# Local AgentReady handoff (example)

Copy this file to `AGENTS.local.md` and keep it untracked. Record only local
coordination facts needed to resume work, such as where private planning notes
live and which checklist should be updated after a material change.

Do not copy secrets into this file. Do not weaken any rule from `AGENTS.md`.

## Local planning workspace

- Private planning root: replace with a local path
- Current handoff note: replace with a local path
- End-of-task update command: replace with a local command, if any

